outines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts. ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Talking About the Future", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "There are several ways in which we can talk about the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "We use the <span class=\"italic\">present simple</span> for something scheduled or arranged:<br><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">We have</span> a lesson next Monday.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "We can use the <span class=\"italic\">present continuous</span> for plans or arrangements:<br><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">I'm playing</span> football tomorrow.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "We use <span class=\"italic\">will</span> when we make predictions about the future:<br><span class=\"italic\">I think Italy <span class=\"strong\">will win</span> the World Cup.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "We also use <span class=\"italic\">will</span> to make offers or promises:<br><span class=\"italic\">Mary <span class=\"strong\">will help</span> you with your homework.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "We use <span class=\"italic\">(be) going to</span> to talk about plans and intentions:<br>I'<span class=\"strong\">m going to drive</span> to work today.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "We also use <span class=\"italic\">(be) going to</span> when we can see something is likely to happen:<br><span class=\"italic\">Be careful! <span class=\"strong\">You are going to fall</span>.</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Talking about Personal Qualities", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you talk about people, you often describe their personal qualities.   You can talk about their  behavior and their personalities.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Behavior is the way a person acts or conducts themself. <br><span class=\"italic\">Example: Tom is usually relaxed, but today he seems nervous. </span> ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Personality is a person's  general character (the way they are). <br><span class=\"italic\">Example: Sandra is a tidy person. Her apartment is always clean and neat.</span> ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "We use adjectives to talk about behavior and personality.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":11,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Synonym\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"dedicated\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"committed; devoted\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"talented\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"skilled; accomplished\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"gracious\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hospitable; accommodating\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"experimental\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"open-minded\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"conservative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"traditional; unprogressive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"stubborn\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"inflexible; single-minded\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"energetic\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"active; lively\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ambitious\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"determined; eager\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"adventurous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bold; daring\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"enthusiastic\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"keen; passionate\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "My sister is adventurous!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I know I can be stubborn at times.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "My very gracious coworker gave me the recipe.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to die for", "type": "name"}, {"content": "extremely good or desirable  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This chocolate cake is to die for! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk with friends.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "gracious", "type": "name"}, {"content": "pleasant; courteous; kind  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He was a very gracious host. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "treasured ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "of great value, perhaps for sentimental reasons  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This is a treasured recipe that was handed down. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to bribe ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to give something to persuade a person to do something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You'll have to bribe her for an invitation. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "experimental ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "willing to try new things  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm very experimental when it comes to food. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "a bottomless pit", "type": "name"}, {"content": "without limits; unable to be filled ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: His stomach is a bottomless pit! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "dedicated ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "giving a great deal of energy and time to something  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They are very dedicated employees. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob10aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "constantly", "type": "name"}, {"content": "happening frequently ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He is constantly asking questions. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob10aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write a 75-90 word paragraph.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain who the person is.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Talk about their personal qualities.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Identify the person's talent and describe what they do with the talent.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your paragraph to a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write about a person.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe their personal qualities.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about a talent they have.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my paragraph aloud.", "type": "text"}]}]}